c_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGAw6_ETtLx3k329INoPViW4P7d8j8J7YipBoUwdZ-7HQ&oe=6A8ACFCB"}, "display_name": "POLYBLOCS", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5BrlqTM9ez4Q7kNvwFODZ5Q&_nc_oc=AdruG2q0jEYQ0TxtFiBkDYhnajTfop0xd0pJkJISUdHUCUWHcw-jJ-_kC1u8kYpjWBQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEiq551TQ7jEsacCG3Qn_x5iRJUQwD_HzNNBlRclP479Q&oe=6A8AC349"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FMP9t2gT-CMQ7kNvwGum7ns&_nc_oc=Ado8HESPvg2zLc2m8IOzOxvI_bmQM-0ZHvE57itlWZLpqQIagGPGu42JH0eN-6xR6Qk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHToxRz8nM2nJ3v5FDSaepypKVXXG3nNkQdjJpIK4RMDw&oe=6A8AC17D"}, {"file_name": "banner pb 1440 1440 v2.png", "id": "1498865307473211", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.577